&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;1&quot; data-border-radius-top-cap=&quot;0&quot; data-border-radius-bottom-cap=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;ask you for payment of any kind during the application or onboarding process, including fees for background checks, training, or equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;always&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;communicate with you using our official company email domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;request your personal financial information, such as your social security number or bank account details, during the initial application stages or via email or a video/voice call when onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
