&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, execute, and optimize end-to-end paid advertising campaigns across multiple marketplace platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance and continuously optimize key metrics such as ROAS, CTR, CPC, CPM, CPA, and CVR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run structured experiments on ad creatives, copy, landing pages, and audience segments to improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams (Commercial, Creator Marketing, Creative, and Live Streaming) to align product assortment, promotional calendars, and content strategies for optimal paid performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients and platform partners to stay updated on the latest marketplace advertising features and developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage comprehensive media plans and budget allocations across platforms including Shopee, Lazada, TikTok Shop, and CPAS (Meta Ads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare comprehensive performance reports on a weekly, monthly, quarterly, and annual basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop full-funnel advertising strategies covering Brand Awareness, Prospecting, Retargeting, and Lookalike audience modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Collaborative Ads (CPAS) on Meta to drive high-intent external traffic to marketplace product pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ongoing keyword research and implement effective bidding strategies (manual vs. auto-bidding) to maintain cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of experience in performance marketing, with a strong focus on marketplace advertising platforms such as Shopee, Lazada, TikTok, and CPAS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of paid media metrics, marketplace dashboards, Meta Ads Manager, Google Ads, and data analysis, with the ability to translate insights into actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of market trends, platform algorithms, and audience behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in presenting campaign results, insights, and strategic recommendations to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in a creative or marketing agency, or advertising platform is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in managing multi-channel client advertising campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Excel and/or Google Sheets (Pivot Tables, VLOOKUP, etc.) and data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with fast growing company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to multiple online marketplaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning driven and collaborative work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

